window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>In the tranquil embrace of the Clochar of the Veiled Sisterhood, Delia Spark finds the days flow with peace and tranquility, far from the familiar streets of Myrtlewood.</b></p> <p>Her sudden disappearance leaves the Crones in turmoil, sparking a fervent quest to find her. Amidst the search, Ingrid's ancestral ties to the Clochar raise further questions.</p> <p>Meanwhile, Marjie is grappling with some family secrets of her own. As the water Crone, her journey demands a plunge into depths unknown, challenging the limits of her courage and revealing the strength of her heart.</p> <p>As the Crones navigate through tangled webs of magic and mystery, their bonds of friendship and power are tested, revealing that the true magic lies in their friendship and the courage to confront the unknown.</p>"; 
